WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,280
Then I'm faster

2
00:00:01,280 --> 00:00:02,280
you two cheated

3
00:00:02,280 --> 00:00:03,880
Being able to solve problems is called skill

4
00:00:03,880 --> 00:00:06,000
No one will give you standard answers on a desert island

5
00:00:08,220 --> 00:00:09,500
I won't get involved with them anymore

6
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:11,420
I'll go down and take care of the goat, sure.

7
00:00:11,420 --> 00:00:13,940
It's the same as making mutton. At least I will go.

8
00:00:13,940 --> 00:00:17,700
By the way, help me keep an eye on the sheepskin and make sure he doesn't run away.

9
00:00:17,700 --> 00:00:18,780
Then I can't lose

10
00:00:18,780 --> 00:00:23,270
This is called cheating, right?

11
00:00:23,270 --> 00:00:24,470
I didn’t step on the grapes

12
00:00:24,470 --> 00:00:26,550
Who will finish their jar first?

13
00:00:26,550 --> 00:00:27,510
Wait a long time

14
00:00:27,510 --> 00:00:28,470
Who tastes it first

15
00:00:30,940 --> 00:00:31,940
Why did you come down?

16
00:00:31,940 --> 00:00:33,380
The job above is not suitable for me

17
00:00:33,380 --> 00:00:35,100
Have you been scolded by Su Che?

18
00:00:35,220 --> 00:00:36,220
I just found

19
00:00:36,220 --> 00:00:37,700
Instead of insisting that you can’t do it

20
00:00:37,700 --> 00:00:38,860
It's better to change it and do it better

21
00:00:38,860 --> 00:00:40,660
That's right, it's also rewarding.

22
00:00:40,660 --> 00:00:45,180
What I'm most afraid of on a desert island is wasting time just to save face. I'll never say that again.

23
00:00:45,180 --> 00:00:46,420
It's disgusting to step on grapes

24
00:00:46,420 --> 00:00:47,860
That at least saves effort

25
00:00:47,860 --> 00:00:49,340
It's too late to regret now

26
00:00:49,340 --> 00:00:50,980
Who makes someone think nonsense first?

27
00:00:50,980 --> 00:00:52,780
You didn’t know why you were watching me at first

28
00:00:52,780 --> 00:00:53,780
I think alone
